---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
import Logo from "../assets/logo.svg";
import { getPostCount } from "../lib/site";

const postCount = await getPostCount();
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-hairline bg-surface/40">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-20">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
      <a
        href="/blog/"
        class="group border border-hairline p-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-accent sm:p-8"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <p class="subsection-title">Read the blog</p>
          <Icon
            name="arrow-right"
            class="size-5 text-ink-faint transition duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:text-accent motion-reduce:group-hover:translate-x-0"
          />
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">
          Two decades and {postCount} entries on programming, business, and management.
          Learn from my successes and (stupid) mistakes.
        </p>
      </a>
      <a
        href="/contact/"
        class="group border border-hairline p-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-accent sm:p-8"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <p class="subsection-title">Say hello</p>
          <Icon
            name="arrow-right"
            class="size-5 text-ink-faint transition duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:text-accent motion-reduce:group-hover:translate-x-0"
          />
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">
          Let's see if we can work together. Or do you just need a little bit of
          advice? Either way, tell me more!
        </p>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 flex justify-center" aria-hidden="true">
      <Logo class="h-6 w-auto [--logo-a:#3d4248] [--logo-s:#24282c]" />
    </div>

    <dl class="mt-8 space-y-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-y-3 md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] md:gap-x-12">
        <dt
          class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-ink-mute uppercase"
        >
          Find me
        </dt>
        <dd class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-sm">
          <a href="https://github.com/aaronsaray" class="quiet-link">GitHub</a>
          <a href="https://codepen.io/aaronsaray" class="quiet-link">CodePen</a>
          <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/aaronsaray" class="quiet-link"
            >LinkedIn</a
          >
          <a href="https://twitter.com/aaronsaray" class="quiet-link">Twitter</a
          >
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-y-3 md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] md:gap-x-12">
        <dt
          class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-ink-mute uppercase"
        >
          Projects
        </dt>
        <dd class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-sm">
          <a href="https://show.nocompromises.io" class="quiet-link"
            >Laravel Podcast</a
          >
          <a href="https://learnthephoneticalphabet.com" class="quiet-link"
            >Learn the Phonetic Alphabet</a
          >
          <a href="https://typesetter.io" class="quiet-link">Typesetter.io</a>
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-y-3 md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] md:gap-x-12">
        <dt
          class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-ink-mute uppercase"
        >
          Other sites
        </dt>
        <dd class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-sm">
          <a href="https://morebetterfaster.io" class="quiet-link"
            >More Better Faster</a
          >
          <a href="https://masteringlaravel.io" class="quiet-link"
            >Mastering Laravel</a
          >
          <a href="https://1lastcheck.com" class="quiet-link">1lastcheck</a>
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>

    <div
      class="mt-10 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-hairline pt-6 text-xs text-ink-mute"
    >
      <p>
        &copy; {year} Aaron Saray. All words come from my <a
          href="/colophon/"
          class="-my-1 inline-block py-1 underline decoration-accent/60 decoration-1 underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-ink hover:decoration-accent"
          >human brain, not AI</a
        >. Licensed under <a
          href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"
          rel="license"
          class="-my-1 inline-block py-1 underline decoration-accent/60 decoration-1 underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-ink hover:decoration-accent"
          >CC BY-SA 4.0</a
        >.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/blog/index.xml"
        class="-my-1.5 flex items-center gap-1.5 py-1.5 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-ink"
      >
        <Icon name="rss" class="size-3.5" />
        RSS
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
